    "show_share": true,
    "description": "\"Jaundice is one of the most common reasons newborn babies are admitted to hospital,\" Dr Syed Rehan Ali, Consultant and Senior Instructor in Neonatal Medicine, Aga Khan University Hospital, Karachi (AKUH,K) said at Aga Khan University Hospital's health awareness programme in Hyderabad.",
